{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块直接交代人物处境、原因和疑问，单扫更容易跟上；X 的高亮词虽然能串起线索，但有些关系需要借普通字号的句子补足。small：X 的感受补出了更多贴着人物处境的细节和不同听法，Y 的部分小字与旁注会重复同一听点，例如 S01 都在描述声音向高处散开。core：X 更完整地反复呈现不再忍受委屈与仍然怀念被当作自己人的拉扯，最后也明确落到不为陪伴回头、带着想念继续生活；concise：Y 压缩了 X 的不少铺陈，整体更利落。human：X 更符合日常说话习惯，Y 的“连开心事都不敢想太难受”“舍不得亲近”“只剩下离开那些人的难受”分别存在语序、搭配或名词化表达生硬的问题；fine：X 的体验更有辨识度，例如“刚要站定，心又被带得飘起来”“越亲切，越能感到它离眼前有多远”，Y 有些感受则收成了较概括的情绪判断；load：X 的大字短语虽然较多，但每块较短，Y 在 S08、S10、S12 等较短屏里连续出现较长的大块，扫读压力更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fd51fe65-f390-46fc-8b91-e37d165ee643", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T185224356641Z", "elapsed_seconds": 334.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T18:57:58.442539+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7209c94ceab2b4400c38a0db666460393506ad3c7da1909178eea7e923943fe6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_we